@startuml
title VN Digital Trust v0.1 - container and trust boundaries
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "SME user / optional reviewer" as User
rectangle "VN Digital Trust deployment (one SME, two branches)" #EAF4FF {
  component "UI + report viewer" as UI
  component "Auth/session + policy gate" as Gate
  component "Inventory + scenario" as Context
  component "Control + evidence intake" as Intake
  component "Verification + control assessment" as Assess
  component "Risk engine + review + treatment" as Risk
  component "Snapshot / report / audit" as History
  database "Transactional metadata\nversions + decisions" as Meta
  folder "Protected evidence bytes\nrevisions" as Store
}
rectangle "External CRM / identity CRM" #FFF1DE {
  component "CRM + WebAuthn verifier" as CRM
}
rectangle "External controlled lab" #FFF1DE {
  component "Test runner / synthetic receiver" as Lab
}
User --> UI : authenticated actions
UI --> Gate : every read/write/export
Gate --> Context
Gate --> Intake
Gate --> Assess
Gate --> Risk
Gate --> History
Context --> Meta
Intake --> Meta : revision metadata
Intake --> Store : staged then committed bytes
Assess --> Meta : decisions + snapshots
Risk --> Meta : snapshots + decisions
History --> Meta : as_of / audit
History --> Store : gated evidence read
CRM --> User : redacted config / logs
Lab --> User : test observations
User --> Intake : submit file / reference
note bottom of Gate
Check active identity, permission,
object scope, assignment and expiry
at execution and commit.
VDT role never grants CRM access.
end note
note bottom of Lab
No direct trusted decision feed.
Runner and receiver remain outside VDT.
end note
@enduml
